onal Pvt. Ltd. on 25th July, 2022 .The Subsidiary Companies have obtained Drug Licenses and other approvals from the Competent Authorities, during the Quarter under review, these Subsidiary Companies were Business Activities    8. The Company is not having any subsidiary Company as on 30/06/2022. The Company has provided Standalone figures for 30/06/2022 for compariing the same with 30/06/2023 on consolidated basis</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock>
